1
00:00:15,950 --> 00:00:20,730
I have just received a letter from my brother, Tim.

2
00:00:20,730 --> 00:00:23,120
He is in Australia.

3
00:00:23,120 --> 00:00:26,500
He has been there for six months.

4
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:28,720
Tim is an engineer.

5
00:00:28,720 --> 00:00:37,610
He is working for a big firm and he has already visited a great number of different places in Australia.

6
00:00:37,610 --> 00:00:47,500
He has just bought an Australian car and has gone to Alice springs, a small town in the centre of Australia.

7
00:00:47,500 --> 00:00:50,090
He will soon visit Darwin.

8
00:00:50,090 --> 00:00:53,810
From there, he will fly to Perth.

9
00:00:53,810 --> 00:01:03,041
My brother has never been abroad before, so he is finding this trip very exciting.
